# The low-memory stress run (stress-boot.sh, make yocto-stress): what comes
# before the #round line runs once, the round as many times as asked, {n}
# its number. Every step has to finish in its time (scaled by
# --timeout-scale) however little memory is left: that is the test; the
# boot script reports memory, pressure and what was ended alongside.
# Messages carry the round's number, so a wait never passes on what an
# earlier round left on the screen, and photos and pages are chosen by name
# (an earlier round leaves the focus elsewhere, and the gallery on the
# video it was playing). The address bar comes up filled with
# the page's address, so its placeholder is no sign of it: its screen is.
== 压力：先放音乐（后台播放的应用不会被结束）
require-audio
key f4
type /
type 音乐
key enter
wait 晨光 30000
key enter
wait 播放中 30000
key f4
#round
== 压力 {n}：短信发出并收到回复
require-tel
key f4
type /
type 短信
key enter
wait 新信息 30000
key f2
wait 收件人号码 30000
type 13800000003
key down
fill 压力测试{n}
key down
key enter
wait 收到：压力测试{n} 30000
key esc
wait 新信息 30000
== 压力 {n}：鸿雁收发消息
key f4
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三 30000
type /
type 张三
key enter
key enter
wait 输入消息 30000
fill 第{n}轮
key enter
wait 收到：第{n}轮 30000
key esc
wait 张三 30000
== 压力 {n}：看图片
key f4
type /
type 图片
key enter
key-if esc / 0:15 3000
wait-re 图片（[0-9]+） 30000
type /
type 海边
key enter
key enter
wait-re · [0-9]+/[0-9]+ 30000
key right
key right
key right
wait-re · [0-9]+/[0-9]+ 30000
key esc
wait-re 图片（[0-9]+） 30000
== 压力 {n}：看视频时打开浏览器（视频离开画面就关闭）
require-video
require-webview
type /
type 湿地
key enter
key enter
wait 正在播放 30000
frames 10 60000
type /
type 浏览器
key enter
key-if g 网页 · 2000
at com.phone.browser/home 30000
fill {chat}/article
key enter
wait 网页 · 键盘手机的第二春 90000
painted 90000
type g
at com.phone.browser/home 30000
fill {chat}/arch
key enter
wait 网页 · 平台架构 90000
painted 90000
type g
at com.phone.browser/home 30000
fill {chat}/tools
key enter
wait 网页 · 工具页 90000
painted 90000
key f4
